---
// TechStack.astro — animated skill badges + experience timeline
---

<section class="mb-16 sm:mb-24">
    <h2 class="mb-8 font-serif text-xl italic sm:mb-12 sm:text-2xl">Technical Skills</h2>

    <div class="space-y-6">
        <!-- Programming -->
        <div>
            <p class="mb-3 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest opacity-60">Programming</p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                {['Python', 'C', 'C++', 'MATLAB', 'MicroPython', 'JavaScript', 'HTML/CSS'].map((skill) => (
                    <span class="skill-badge">{skill}</span>
                ))}
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Hardware -->
        <div>
            <p class="mb-3 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest opacity-60">Hardware & Microcontrollers</p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                {['ESP32', 'STM32', 'FPGA', 'Verilog', 'Raspberry Pi', 'Sensors', 'Motors'].map((skill) => (
                    <span class="skill-badge">{skill}</span>
                ))}
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Tools -->
        <div>
            <p class="mb-3 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest opacity-60">Tools & Frameworks</p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                {['KiCAD', 'Altium Designer', 'LTSpice', 'TensorFlow', 'Fusion 360', 'MongoDB', 'ROS2'].map((skill) => (
                    <span class="skill-badge">{skill}</span>
                ))}
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Other -->
        <div>
            <p class="mb-3 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest opacity-60">Other</p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                {['Linux', 'Git', 'Docker', 'API Integration', 'PLC Programming'].map((skill) => (
                    <span class="skill-badge">{skill}</span>
                ))}
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="mb-16 sm:mb-24">
    <h2 class="mb-8 font-serif text-xl italic sm:mb-12 sm:text-2xl">Experience</h2>

    <div class="space-y-8">
        <!-- Wavelogix -->
        <div class="experience-card group">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-1 sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between">
                <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-medium leading-tight">Embedded Systems Intern</h3>
                <span class="shrink-0 text-sm opacity-60">May – Jul 2026</span>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-0.5 text-sm font-medium opacity-70">Wavelogix, Inc. · West Lafayette, IN</p>
            <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                <li>→ Deployed production C GNSS firmware on Quectel 4G modules using an FSM; maintained sub-2.0 HDOP</li>
                <li>→ Built automated HIL test bench (Python, RPi, Nordic PPK2) for firmware validation & power profiling</li>
                <li>→ Resolved STM32 telemetry bug + wrote unit tests; built full-stack Python GUI for manufacturing workflows</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- SoCET -->
        <div class="experience-card group">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-1 sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between">
                <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-medium leading-tight">Undergraduate Researcher</h3>
                <span class="shrink-0 text-sm opacity-60">Aug 2026 – Present</span>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-0.5 text-sm font-medium opacity-70">SoCET Design Flow — Clock Optimization · Purdue University</p>
            <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                <li>→ H-tree-based global clock distribution for the AFTx08 SoC in Synopsys Fusion Compiler (Tcl)</li>
                <li>→ Configured clock buffers and routing to minimize skew in multi-source Clock Tree Synthesis (CTS)</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- ARC -->
        <div class="experience-card group">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-1 sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between">
                <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-medium leading-tight">Electronic Engineering Lead</h3>
                <span class="shrink-0 text-sm opacity-60">Aug 2024 – Present</span>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-0.5 text-sm font-medium opacity-70">Autonomous Robotics Club · Purdue University</p>
            <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                <li>→ Built piano-playing robotic hand; PID finger control with &lt;10% position error</li>
                <li>→ Designed multi-layer PCB (KiCAD), buck converter, PMOS switch, and BLE wireless control</li>
                <li>→ Migrating architecture from ESP32/MicroPython to STM32 for v2</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Humanoid -->
        <div class="experience-card group">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-1 sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between">
                <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-medium leading-tight">Electrical Engineer</h3>
                <span class="shrink-0 text-sm opacity-60">Jan 2025 – Present</span>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-0.5 text-sm font-medium opacity-70">Humanoid Robotics Club · Purdue University</p>
            <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                <li>→ Led PCB design for the full-leg actuation system (Altium Designer)</li>
                <li>→ Hardware testing & validation using proprietary Unitree software; sensor integration</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .skill-badge {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem;
        border: 1px dashed var(--border-main);
        border-radius: 9999px;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-family: var(--font-sans);
        transition: background-color 0.15s ease, border-style 0.15s ease;
        cursor: default;
    }
    .skill-badge:hover {
        border-style: solid;
        background-color: var(--bg-muted);
    }
    .experience-card {
        padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
        border-left: 2px dashed var(--border-main);
        transition: border-style 0.15s ease, padding-left 0.15s ease;
    }
    .experience-card:hover {
        border-style: solid;
        padding-left: 1.5rem;
    }
</style>
